Third-Party Instrument & Copyright Notices (Excluded from Project Ownership):
- Moral Foundations Questionnaire 2 (MFQ-2): Adapted from Atari, M., Haidt, J.,
  Graham, J., Koleva, S., Stevens, S. T., & Dehghani, M. (2023), Journal of
  Personality and Social Psychology, 125(5); OSF materials (https://osf.io/srtxn/)
  are licensed by the original authors under CC BY 4.0. Modifications in
  MoralityBench substitute non-human entity/collective terminology and replace
  four Purity items (items 6, 12, 30, 36).
- Ethics Position Questionnaire (EPQ): Forsyth, D. R. (1980), Journal of
  Personality and Social Psychology, 39(1), 175-184. Remains Copyright (c) 1980
  American Psychological Association (APA). Excluded from CC BY 4.0; item texts
  are redacted from public archives and displays.
- Defining Issues Test, Version 2 (DIT-2): Copyrighted instrument of the Center
  for the Study of Ethical Development, University of Alabama. Excluded from
  CC BY 4.0; dilemma texts and item-level answers are withheld.
